 {showCodeFlag}∆RunThese pattern;list;this;flag;answer;n;firstFlag
⍝ Run all demos starting with "pattern"
 list←(⎕NL-3)~'∆'⎕NL-3
 pattern←⊂⍣(2>≡pattern)⊣pattern
 list/⍨←↑∨/∨/¨pattern⍷¨⊂⊃list
 :If showCodeFlag←{0<⎕NC ⍵:⍎⍵ ⋄ 0}'showCodeFlag'
     n←∆CreateBrowser ⍬
 :EndIf
 firstFlag←1
 :For this :In list
     flag←0
     :Repeat
         :If firstFlag
             ⎕←'*** Ready to go? Press <Enter>!'
             0/⍞
             firstFlag←0
         :EndIf
         ⎕←'*** ',this
         ⎕←'    ',1⊃⎕NR this
         :If showCodeFlag
             n ∆ShowCode this
         :EndIf
         ⍎this
         →(this≡↑⌽list)/∆Done
_Ask:
         ⎕←'Press one of:'
         ⎕←'<enter> for the next demo'
         ⎕←'<e> for editing this demo fns'
         ⎕←'<q> for quitting'
         answer←¯1↑⍞
         →(~answer∊' qQeE')/_Ask
         :If answer∊'eE'
             ⎕ED this
         :ElseIf answer∊'Qq'
             →∆Done
         :Else
             flag←1
         :EndIf
     :Until flag
 :EndFor
∆Done:
 :If showCodeFlag
     n.∆CloseForm
 :EndIf
